  "solution": "Gọi độ dài cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> mét (đk: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>). Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> <br>Theo định lý Pythgore: \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Diện tích mảnh vườn là \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">)</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
